{"results":[{"url":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2020/09/04/joe-biden-not-banning-fracking-defense-explained/","final_url":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2020/09/04/joe-biden-not-banning-fracking-defense-explained/","title":"Analysis | Joe Biden’s ‘not banning fracking’ defense, explained","description":"He wants to stop new permits on public lands, and he misspoke about it once.","language":"en","text":"Democracy Dies in Darkness\n\nAnalysis by  Amber Phillips\n\nJoe Biden was unequivocal Monday on his position for one of the more politically sensitive climate change debates: whether to ban the profitable and controversial natural gas extraction process known as fracking.\n\n---","author":"Amber Phillips","published_date":"2020-09-01T13:21:38.192Z","latency_ms":1543.7368829998377,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}